Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Comic Downloader contributors <maintainers@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), python3, python3-pip
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/fallen020/comic-dl
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/fallen020/comic-dl.git

Package: comic-dl
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11),
         python3-bs4,
         python3-lxml,
         python3-rich,
         python3-platformdirs,
         python3-defusedxml,
         python3-certifi,
         python3-cffi,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Download comic and manga galleries as CBZ archives
 comic-dl downloads comic and manga galleries from supported websites and
 compiles them into CBZ, ZIP, and CBT archives.
 .
 The only runtime dependency that Debian does not package (curl-cffi) is
 bundled as a prebuilt abi3 wheel under /usr/lib/comic-dl/site-packages.
